  "stateNote": "In a mixing bowl, combine the beef strips, sliced onions, minced garlic, grated ginger, niter kibbeh, berbere spice blend, paprika, cayenne pepper, cumin, coriander, cardamom, and salt. Mix well to ensure the beef is coated with the marinade. Cover the bowl and let it marinate in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour, or overnight for more intense flavors.",
